<view class="result-page" wx:if="{{result.name}}">
  <view class="result-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{result.color}}, #8fc1e0);">
    <text class="result-emoji">{{result.emoji}}</text><text class="result-name">{{result.name}}</text><text class="result-title">{{result.title}}</text><text class="result-desc">{{result.desc}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="result-section"><text class="section-title">你的偏好代码</text><text class="type-code" style="color:{{result.color}};">{{result.mbtiType}}</text><text class="type-note">它描述当前偏好，不代表能力高低，也不是永久不变的身份。</text></view>
  <view class="result-section"><text class="section-title">可能的优势</text><view class="strength-item" wx:for="{{result.strengths}}" wx:key="*this"><text class="strength-dot" style="color:{{result.color}};">✦</text><text>{{item}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="result-section"><text class="section-title">成长建议</text><view class="strength-item" wx:for="{{result.growth}}" wx:key="*this"><text class="strength-dot">○</text><text>{{item}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="result-section"><text class="section-title">可探索方向</text><text class="career-text">{{result.careers}}</text></view>
  <view class="result-disclaimer"><text>本结果仅供娱乐与自我探索，不属于专业心理评估，不进入心理健康评分、风险预警或管理决策。</text></view>
  <view class="result-actions"><view class="retry-btn" bindtap="goBack">重新探索</view></view>
</view>
